-- =====================================================
-- S015: Normalized speciality years (h_speciality_year)
-- =====================================================
-- Source: etl_speciality.py — dot AND comma are BOTH discrete-year separators,
--         NOT ranges: '2021.2023'->{2021,2023}, '2024.2026'->{2024,2026}. Years
--         2022 & 2025 are absent from the source xlsx entirely (literal count 0),
--         so they are NEVER inserted (they are not gap-filled from dot values).
--         The ETL emits years only for the APPROVED (xlsx) L3 rows; ~2264 rows
--         (mostly the L4 inner directions + the hand-entered NEEDS_REVIEW rows)
--         come out year-less.
-- ON CONFLICT (speciality_id, year) DO NOTHING.
-- A backfill block at the END of this file inherits parent years for every
-- year-less child, so after this changeset NO row is year-less (the API then
-- enforces years as mandatory). See that block for details.
-- MANUAL CORRECTIONS (2026-08-08, user-confirmed) — re-apply ALL if the ETL re-runs:
--   1) cb0ff8f5 (70530402 'Gidrogeologiya', MASTER): dropped its 2026 year row -> keeps only 2024.
--   2) '0900000 TESTLASH' test subtree: removed its 11 year rows (see S014 header).
--   3) 6b1a240d (5230300 'Kichik biznes va xususiy tadbirkorlik...', BACHELOR): year 2020 -> 2019.
--   4) 8c39f8c8 (70320401 'Kutubxona axborot faoliyati', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps only 2024.
--   5) c6298266 (70910102 'Yuz-jagʻ xirurgiyasi', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps 2021/2023/2024
--      (its 2026 successor 'Yuz-jagʻ jarrohligi' is added as a NEW row in S017).
--   6) ca57647a (70910212 'Xirurgiya', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps 2024
--      (its 2026 successor 'Jarrohlik' is added as a NEW row in S017).
--   7) 03da8c0a (70910214 'Neyroxirurgiya', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps 2021/2023/2024
--      (its 2026 successor 'Neyrojarrohlik' is added as a NEW row in S017).
--   8) 6498cda0 (70910302 'Bolalar xirurgiyasi', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps 2021/2023/2024
--      (its 2026 successor 'Bolalar jarrohligi' is added as a NEW row in S017).
--   9) 7f836768 (71031301 'Jamoat xavfsizligi', MASTER): dropped its 2026 row -> keeps 2021/2023/2024
